                    %msub
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mrow
                        %mi i
                        %mo ∈
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
                        %mn 1
                        %mo ,
                        %mi ⋯
                        %mo ,
                        %mi n
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} }
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (x^i, p_i)_{i \in \{1, \cdots, n\}}
              is of the form
            .maruku-equation
